System should support multiple theaters, with each theater has multiple screens.
One Movie can have multiple screenings across screens, in multiple theaters & time-slots.

Each screen has a grid like structure for seats.
Seat has different types based on which pricing will be calculated (normal, vip, premium)

Users should be able to search movies & book available tickets.
A ticket represent a single seat in a screening.
Multiple tickets can be booked for a screening.